    {
      "id": "9571be12-39da-4b74-8cdf-2bcd77ad144c",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview & setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1152,
        -464
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 988,
        "height": 2160,
        "content": "# Audit landing pages for conversion issues with AI vision and email the CRO report\n# 📥  [Open full documentation on Notion](https://automatisation.notion.site/Course-Audit-landing-pages-for-conversion-issues-with-AI-vision-and-email-the-CRO-report-3a43d6550fd98188b0adf3049ee1fd11)\n\n## How it works\nPaste a landing page URL into the form. The workflow scrapes the HTML, captures a live screenshot, and sends both to an AI agent that analyses conversion issues from a text AND a visual angle. It returns a scored audit across six categories, a friendly roast of the page, and a list of highly specific recommendations. The report is converted to HTML, logged to Google Sheets so you can track pages over time, and emailed to the address given in the form.\n\nCanvas map, left to right:\n1. Collect the page\n2. Audit it with AI\n3. Build the report\n4. Log & send\n\n## Setup\n1. Select your OpenAI credential on **Analyze Screenshot With Vision** and on the two **OpenAI Model** sub-nodes.\n2. Select your Gmail credential on **Send CRO Report by Email**.\n3. Select your Google Sheets credential on **Log Audit to Google Sheets**, then pick a spreadsheet and tab. Column mapping is automatic: create the columns you want to keep from `audit_date`, `landing_page_url`, `overall_score`, `score_headline`, `score_cta`, `score_trust`, `score_design`, `score_mobile`, `score_copywriting`, `recipient_email`.\n4. Open **Configuration** and set your OpenAI model, the number of recommendations, the screenshot width and whether the email report is enabled.\n5. Activate the workflow and share the form's production URL.\n\n## Requirements\n- An OpenAI API key with access to a vision-capable model (default: `gpt-5-mini`).\n- A Gmail account connected to n8n, to send the report.\n- A Google Sheets account and one spreadsheet used as the audit log.\n- No extra API key is needed for the screenshot: the free thum.io service is used. For higher volume or a watermark-free capture, swap the URL in **Capture Landing Page Screenshot** for a paid screenshot API.\n\n## Customization\n- Change `openai_model`, `num_recommendations`, `screenshot_width` and `enable_email_report` in **Configuration**.\n- Edit the system message of **Generate CRO Audit** to change the tone: the default deliberately roasts the page in a casual voice, which is not always what a client wants to receive.\n- Add categories to the structured output schema for a deeper breakdown, then add the matching lines to **Prepare Report Data**.\n\nThe audit is an AI opinion, not a measurement: treat the recommendations as hypotheses to A/B test, not as facts.\n\n---\nNeed help customizing?\nContact me for consulting and support : [Linkedin](https://www.linkedin.com/in/doctor-firass/)\n\n# MY NEW YOUTUBE CHANNEL\n👉 [Subscribe to my new YouTube channel](https://www.youtube.com/@DrFiras_AI). Here I'll share videos and Shorts with practical tutorials and FREE templates for n8n.\n\n[![The AI Doctor](https://www.dr-firas.com/the-ai-doctor.png)](https://www.youtube.com/@DrFiras_AI)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3f633738-c6f5-4c98-b6df-db0b78ca4a7a",
