      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1140,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## 1. Collect the page\nThe form takes the URL and the optional email address, **Configuration** centralises every adjustable setting, then the page is captured twice: the raw HTML for the copy and structure, and a live screenshot for the visual side."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e246e121-317e-4bb0-857f-b70d683f4990",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Step 2 AI audit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1104,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1060,
        "height": 800,
        "content": "## 2. Audit it with AI\nA vision model describes what the page actually looks like, then the agent combines that description with the HTML to produce a scored audit, a roast and personalised recommendations. The structured output parser enforces the JSON schema, with a second model wired to it to auto-fix a malformed answer."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
