        "content": "## 3. Build the report\nThe structured audit is flattened into a Markdown report, then converted to HTML ready to be sent by email."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "eec5533d-b5a6-41a3-86dc-c8f45cb12005",
